Bundled third-party data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The source of this crate holds third-party data: the names of the WMO's centers
and sub-centers, and the ECMWF local parameter tables. It is redistributed under
its own terms:

  * The GRIB2 parameter, surface and time-range names, and the names of
    originating centers, sub-centers and chemical constituents, are generated
    from the World Meteorological Organization's code tables
    (https://github.com/wmo-im/GRIB2 and https://github.com/wmo-im/CCT),
    published under the MIT License. Their LICENSE.md is below.
  * The ECMWF and DWD local GRIB2 parameter names and the ECMWF local GRIB1
    parameter tables are generated from the definitions shipped with ecCodes
    (https://github.com/ecmwf/eccodes), © ECMWF, licensed under the Apache
    License, Version 2.0. ecCodes' NOTICE is below.

